    "body": "@nondebug HI matt, I found that my problem is essentially a duplicate of this issue reported two years ago,  https://github.com/WICG/webhid/issues/65, since on Windows it seems not possible to wait for all topl level collections to be enumerated before firing the connect event, is there any update on the implementation of the  'devicechange' event you mentioned as sort of workaround in the issue ",
